OL,3,GNEWSADozens of bags of rubbish picked
OL,4,Aup along the A14
OL,5,
OL,6,FLitter including a shopping trolley and
OL,7,Fa roof-rack has been collected along a
OL,8,Fbusy dual carriageway during two months
OL,9,Fof overnight closures.
OL,11,FNational Highways said a total of 127
OL,12,Fbags of rubbish had been filled by
OL,13,Fcontractors along the A14 between
OL,14,FRothwell and Kettering,
OL,15,FNorthamptonshire.
OL,17,FThe closures meant they could get to
OL,18,Fareas that were usually difficult to
OL,19,Freach safely because of traffic.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
