OL,3,GNEWSADozens of bags of rubbish picked
OL,4,Aup along the A14
OL,5,
OL,6,FLewis Tooley, from National Highways,
OL,7,Fsaid: "If people didn't drop litter in
OL,8,Fthe first place, it wouldn't need to be
OL,9,Fpicked up."
